('127.263.d.9.B',3,'Facial expressions and posture are forms of:','["Symbolic code only", "Spoken communication", "Nonverbal communication", "Written communication"]'::jsonb,2,'Body language.','original'),
('127.263.d.9.B',4,'A salesperson who crosses their arms and avoids eye contact may seem:','["Welcoming", "Very helpful", "Enthusiastic", "Uninterested or defensive"]'::jsonb,3,'Body language sends messages.','original'),
