('127.263.d.9.C',4,'A flyer is judged effective if it leads to:','["More paper use", "An increase in store visits or sales", "Fewer customers", "Higher rent"]'::jsonb,1,'Results measure success.','original'),
('127.263.d.9.D',3,'A news story about a store''s charity drive is an example of:','["Paid advertising", "Personal selling", "Public relations", "Sales promotion"]'::jsonb,2,'Free publicity.','original'),
('127.263.d.9.D',4,'Unlike public relations, advertising is:','["Unplanned", "Written by reporters", "Always free", "Paid for by the company"]'::jsonb,3,'Ads are purchased.','original'),
('127.263.d.9.E',3,'A tool a retailer might use to promote items is a:','["Mobile app with deals", "Closed sign", "Paper map only", "Locked door"]'::jsonb,0,'Tech supports promotion.','original'),
('127.263.d.9.E',4,'Sending a coupon to shoppers'' phones based on their purchase history uses:','["A radio spot", "Customer data technology", "A window decal", "A billboard"]'::jsonb,1,'Targeted offers.','original'),
('127.263.d.10.A',3,'Prospecting, solution development, and referrals are:','["Store layouts", "Inventory methods", "Sales-generating techniques", "Accounting tools"]'::jsonb,2,'Ways to build sales.','original'),
('127.263.d.10.A',4,'Asking a satisfied customer to recommend the store to friends is a:','["Cold call", "Return", "Discount", "Referral technique"]'::jsonb,3,'Word of mouth.','original'),
('127.263.d.10.B',3,'An associate who is honest about a product''s limits builds:','["Customer trust", "Lost sales always", "Lawsuits", "Customer fear"]'::jsonb,0,'Ethics build trust.','original'),
