('127.263.d.10.E',3,'Determining needs, presenting the product, and handling objections are all parts of the:','["Shipping process", "Hiring process", "Selling process", "Banking process"]'::jsonb,2,'Steps in a sale.','original'),
('127.263.d.10.E',4,'Handling an objection such as ''it costs too much'' often involves:','["Raising price", "Arguing", "Ignoring it", "Emphasizing value and benefits"]'::jsonb,3,'Address concerns.','original'),
