('127.263.d.11.A',4,'A clear store layout with wide aisles helps shoppers to:','["Avoid purchases", "Get lost", "Leave quickly", "Find products and stay longer"]'::jsonb,3,'Layout drives flow.','original'),
('127.263.d.11.B',3,'Visual merchandising design elements include color, line, balance, and:','["Proportion", "Taxes", "Payroll", "Shipping"]'::jsonb,0,'Design elements.','original'),
