('127.263.d.12.C',3,'To recruit a diverse pool of talent, a retailer should:','["Hide the posting", "Limit to friends", "Advertise openings widely and inclusively", "Post in one place only"]'::jsonb,2,'Broad outreach.','original'),
('127.263.d.12.C',4,'Including inclusive language in a job posting helps attract:','["Only one group", "No one", "Fewer applicants", "A wider range of qualified applicants"]'::jsonb,3,'Inclusive wording.','original'),
('127.263.d.12.D',3,'The Equal Employment Opportunity Commission enforces laws that prohibit:','["Job discrimination", "Littering", "Tax evasion", "Parking fines"]'::jsonb,0,'EEOC role.','original'),
